#!args --demo
# the demo headless: its view draws on a device of its own and every frame is read back; a drag with the middle button pans
# the drawing with the pointer, the wheel zooms at the pointer (the red line through x = 0 is 9 px wide, at the view's
# middle, x 360; the blue line through y = 50 is 5 px wide, at y 222; the view starts at y 32, 1 unit = 1 px).  G6d: a
# window drawn with the left button selects (blue, grips), the line under the pointer is highlighted (orange), a click
# picks, Esc clears
wait 600
expect pixel 358 300 #D02020
expect pixel 600 222 #2040C0
# a window around the part's slot (a line from (-40, -20) to (40, -20), 14 units wide, round, translucent): selected, its
# grips at its ends and middle; a pixel of it away from the red line and the grid
expect pixel 385 288 #7C9F8A
drag 300,278 420,306
wait 200
expect pixel 385 288 #618FD7
expect pixel 400 291 #1E64FF
key esc
wait 200
expect pixel 385 288 #7C9F8A
drag 358,300 458,300 middle
wait 200
# the red line under the pointer: hovered, orange, 2 px wider (the pointer's snap marker sits where it crosses the grid)
expect pixel 458 400 #F97F1B
# one notch at (458, 300): 2^(1/4) larger about the pointer, the red line stays under it, the blue line moves up to 207
wheel 458,300 120
wait 200
expect pixel 458 400 #F97F1B
expect pixel 600 207 #2040C0
# a click picks the red line; the pointer away: selected, blue
click 458,400
wait 200
move 650,470
wait 200
expect pixel 458 420 #4B53C7
key esc
wait 200
expect pixel 458 420 #D02020
